define task_checklist_schema returning Str:
    return "{\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"task_checklist\",\"description\":\"Save the durable checklist for your current task, whether working directly for the user or as a delegated agent. Ordinary conversation and read-only lookups need no checklist. Define your own tasks from the explicit assigned requirements. The current list is supplied automatically on every turn. Submit updates alongside work calls in the same response; no separate planning or lookup turn is required. An empty list does not block work. Create the list with items; afterward prefer updates containing only changed item IDs, status and evidence. Unmentioned items are preserved automatically. Use concise source/event references for evidence; detailed findings are already retained in tool observations. Do not rewrite unchanged items or update merely to repeat a completed read. A full items snapshot remains available for scope revision; stable IDs and requirements cannot be dropped or changed unless new user or parent guidance was applied. Mark done with observed evidence of work already performed, not a claim that an unsent reply was delivered.  Mark unresolved with the concrete limitation allowed by the assignment. Keep evidence and completed reads so you do not repeat them. When the work is ready, submit the last updates with final_response containing the actual user-facing answer. Make that the only tool call in the response. The runtime saves the checklist and delivers your exact answer without another model turn. Do not create a separate task merely to announce completion or draft the answer twice. A normal final reply without checklist changes remains allowed. Supply exactly one of items or updates.\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"requirement\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"pending\",\"done\",\"unresolved\"]},\"evidence\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"requirement\",\"status\",\"evidence\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"updates\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"pending\",\"done\",\"unresolved\"]},\"evidence\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"status\",\"evidence\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"final_response\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Actual final reply to deliver after the checklist update succeeds. Only use when no requirements remain pending, and as the sole tool call.\"}},\"required\":[],\"additionalProperties\":false}}}"
